==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Plasma Blast|Machoke|48}} from the {{TCG|Plasma Blast}} expansion.
**[[Lentimas Town]] from {{B2W2}} is featured in the background of the illustration.
*This card's shiny rare illustration features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Machoke}}.
*{{m|Strength}} is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Machoke}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

